# The build context of Dockerfile.sandbox (Docker reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside a Dockerfile given with -f): everything is left out, the deployment's state folder .sdp with the chat's credential included, but the files the Dockerfile copies (Python's byte-code caches left out too).
*
!requirements-sandbox.txt
!social_data_pipeline/__init__.py
!social_data_pipeline/control/__init__.py
!social_data_pipeline/control/errors.py
!social_data_pipeline/control/framing.py
!social_data_pipeline/chat/
**/__pycache__
